ualias (0.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Implement USB device alias lookup/append against /etc/udev/devices.
  * Support vendor/product/serial wildcards with first-match order
    (ESP32-S3 fallback).
  * Add -u/--ucfirst for uppercasing the alias name.
  * Satisfy zfr lint: L1 man locales, posync/symlink scripts, CI
    helpers, rpm %files.

